 top-full left-0 hidden group-hover:block bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-lg shadow-lg py-2 min-w-[180px] z-50\"><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">Lawn Care</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/landscaping\">Landscaping</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/pest-control\">Pest Control</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/tree-care\">Tree Care</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/gardening\">Gardening</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/home-garden\">Home &amp; Garden</a><a class=\"block px-4 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/grass-types\">Grass Types</a></div></div><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/authors\">Authors</a><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About</a></nav><button class=\"md:hidden p-2 rounded-md hover:bg-[var(--color-muted)] cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-6 mb-10\"><div class=\"relative w-24 h-24 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-[var(--color-muted)]\"><img alt=\"Emily Watson\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A012b7f3797f84c70a6630eabe76e8f8fl.jpg\"/></div><div><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">Emily Watson</h1><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] max-w-xl\">Board-Certified Master Arborist (BCMA) and urban forestry consultant with over 20 years of field experience. Holds a Ph.D. in Forest Pathology from the University of Georgia. Has assessed and treated more than 50,000 trees across municipal, commercial, and residential settings. Co-authored the ISA Best Management Practices for Urban Tree Risk Assessment. Serves as expert witness in tree-related legal disputes and has been featured on NPR Science Friday discussing climate adaptation strategies for urban canopies.</p></div></div><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6\">Articles by <!-- -->Emily Watson</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/best-grass-seed-for-wisconsin\"><img alt=\"Best Grass Seed for Wisconsin: Top Varieties for a Lush, Hardy Lawn\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ad4d8f93855f64eeb938df21b7ec890abU.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/grass-types\">Grass Types</a><a href=\"/blog/best-grass-seed-for-wisconsin\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Best Grass Seed for Wisconsin: Top Varieties for a Lush, Hardy Lawn</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Discover the best grass seed for Wisconsin lawns. Compare cool-season grass varieties, growing tips, and expert maintenance advice for year-round beauty.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Emily Watson</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-30 00:24:31\">Aug 30, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/diagnose-correct-nutrient-deficiencies-evergreen-trees\"><img alt=\"How to Diagnose &amp; Correct Nutrient Deficiencies in Evergreen Trees\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ad391ad4aebe945b0b824302fef14e66eX.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/tree-care\">Tree Care</a><a href=\"/blog/diagnose-correct-nutrient-deficiencies-evergreen-trees\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">How to Diagnose &amp; Correct Nutrient Deficiencies in Evergreen Trees</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Learn how to identify and fix common nutrient deficiencies in evergreen trees. Expert tips on symptoms, soil testing, fertilization, and long-term tree health.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Emily Watson</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-26 00:31:51\">Aug 26, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/lawn-care-schedule-northeast\"><img alt=\"Northeast Lawn Care Schedule: A Complete Season-by-Season Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A46ee71f639f544d5947e575d76ef530d4.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">Lawn Care</a><a href=\"/blog/lawn-care-schedule-northeast\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Northeast Lawn Care Schedule: A Complete Season-by-Season Guide</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Master your Northeast lawn care schedule with our month-by-month guide covering fertilizing, mowing, aeration, overseeding &amp; seasonal tips for a lush yard.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Emily Watson</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-26 00:23:04\">Aug 26, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-co